    {
      "key": "",
      "read_index": "1",
      "tag_source": "source_en",
      "source_jp": "状況が悪化し、獣の将が強き魔物を呼び寄せる――！",
      "source_en": "The situation worsens as the Beast Master summons\r\npowerful enemies!",
      "text": "Die Lage spitzt sich zu!\r\nDer Bestiengeneral ruft mächtige Monster herbei!"
